<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT KENYA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT KENYA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Kenya by seven</p>
<p>wickets in the opening match of the Kenyan centenary four-nation</p>
<p>cricket tournament on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kenya 188-9 in 50 overs innings closed; Sri Lanka</p>
<p>190-3 in 30.4 overs</p>
</text>
